### Task 3.6: WalletSettingsTab Silent Error (Issue #16)
**Priority:** MEDIUM | **Risk:** LOW | **Time:** 15 minutes

**File to modify:**
- `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/Rankora/src/components/admin/WalletSettingsTab.tsx` (line 67)

