### Task 4.5: Write Core Tests (Issue #30)
**Priority:** HIGH | **Risk:** NONE | **Time:** 3 hours

**Files to create:**
- `src/test/validate.test.ts` -- Test the credit validation logic
- `src/test/csvExport.test.ts` -- Test CSV export helper
- `src/test/useFeatureFlags.test.ts` -- Test feature flag loading states
- `src/test/PaymentCallback.test.ts` -- Test payment polling logic

